       </draw:frame>Figure <text:sequence text:ref-name="refFigure2" text:name="Figure" text:formula="ooow:Figure+1" style:num-format="1">1</text:sequence>: PnDevice showing IM0 tab for an ET200SP</text:p>
     </draw:text-box>
    </draw:frame><text:line-break/><text:span text:style-name="T13">RestartLimit 0 in RemNode objects</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1220_1340120094"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P32">A RestartLimit of 0 in RemNode objects will now tell rs_remotehandler to restart the remnode handler process at all times but with an increasing backoff if it does not stay alive for a set amount of time.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P33" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1334_1340120094"/><text:span text:style-name="T13">Notable </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T23">Additions</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1334_1340120094"/></text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1222_1340120094"/>Datatype BitField added<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1222_1340120094"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34">A new datatype BitField8/16/32/64 has been added that isn’t byte swapped by the <text:span text:style-name="T24">IO</text:span> framework.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P35" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1224_1340120094"/><text:soft-page-break/>New Profinet viewer<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1224_1340120094"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34">A new <text:span text:style-name="T24">Profinet V</text:span>iewer has been added and the old one removed.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Frame1" text:anchor-type="char" svg:width="16.999cm" draw:z-index="6">
     <draw:text-box fo:min-height="14.543cm">
