    </draw:frame><text:line-break/>It will also give you a workflow hint.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P45">The new tool will also log the upgrade procedure to <text:span text:style-name="T30">$pwrp_log </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T31">for your convenience.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P47">If in the future you come from a V7.0 system the procedure is to run phase 1, which is the dump right now, in the old project instead of reload.sh.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P47"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P48">The new tool will check locks on the database before proceeding with the upgrade:</text:p>
